SUMMARY:Deadline: Aesthetica Art Prize 2026 (20th edition)
DESCRIPTION:The Aesthetica Art Prize accepts work in any discipline and the
 me\, with video\, installation\, digital\, and photography regularly short
 listed\; past shortlists frequently feature critical-tech and surveillance
 -adjacent work\, making it a strong venue for media art. Main Prize GBP 10
 \,000 plus a group exhibition at York Art Gallery and editorial coverage. 
 Standard deadline 11 October 2026 (GBP 25 for two works)\; late entries 12
 -18 October 2026 (GBP 35).\n\nOrganisation: Aesthetica Magazine\nLocation:
  York\, United Kingdom (exhibition at York Art Gallery\, spring 2027). Ope
 n worldwide\, no age or nationality restrictions.\nAward: Main Prize GBP 1
 0\,000 plus exhibition at York Art Gallery and publication in the Antholog
 y\; Emerging Prize GBP 1\,000 (students and graduates within 3 years). Ent
 ry GBP 25 for two works (late entries GBP 35).\nDuration: Exhibition at Yo
 rk Art Gallery\, spring 2027.\n\nMore: https://aestheticamagazine.com/artp
 rize/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://aestheticamagazine.com/artprize/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugr
 antdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:York\, United Kingdom (exhibition at York Art Gallery\, spring 202
 7). Open worldwide\, no age or nationality restrictions.
